  "description": "Have a blast while honing your scooter skills with the Trace 100 Folding Scooter by Mongoose. The Trace 100 scooter features Full-coverage MaxGrip™ on the lightweight alloy deck and steel brake to ensure a secure, stable ride, while soft foam grips offer comfortable handling. The 100 mm wheels come with ABEC – 7 bearings for long lasting use. And when it’s time to pack up for the day, the Trace folds for convenient storage and transport. This scooter can accommodate a wide variety of riders thanks to the quick-release adjustable height, complete with three lock-in pins, and a heavy-duty frame supports that up to 176 lbs. Get performance, convenience, and fun with the Trace 100.",
